        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>如何看待线上教育？</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Times New Roman', SimSun, serif;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            padding: 30px;\n            color: #000;\n            background-color: #fff;\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .highlight-title {\n            background-color: #ffff00;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            font-size: 18px;\n        }\n        .main-section {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .main-point {\n            background-color: #d9d9d9;\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 15px 2px 5px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n        }\n        .main-point .bullet {\n            margin-right: 8px;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: scale(1.2);\n        }\n        .sub-list {\n            list-style-type: circle;\n            padding-left: 45px;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n        .sub-list li {\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            padding-left: 5px;\n            text-align: justify;\n        }\n        .text-red-underline {\n            color: #c00000;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n            text-decoration-color: #c00000;\n            text-underline-offset: 3px;\n        }\n        .text-red {\n            color: #c00000;\n        }\n        .text-blue {\n            color: #0070c0;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"highlight-title\">如何看待线上教育？</div>\n\n    <div class=\"main-section\">\n        <div class=\"main-point\"><span class=\"bullet\">&#8226;</span> Introduction 开头</div>\n        <ul class=\"sub-list\">\n            <li><span class=\"text-red-underline\">The pandemic is ranging across the globe, and students are reeling from it.</span> <span class=\"text-blue\">(背景)</span> During the lockdown, students have no other choice but to study from home, making online education more popular. <span class=\"text-blue\">(引出话题)</span> <span class=\"text-red-underline\">In my view, it has both pros and cons, and should be used wisely.</span> <span class=\"text-blue\">(抛出观点)</span></li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"main-section\">\n        <div class=\"main-point\"><span class=\"bullet\">&#8226;</span> Pros 好处</div>\n        <ul class=\"sub-list\">\n            <li>For students, online education is more flexible. <span class=\"text-red\">Rather than being restricted in classrooms,</span> leaners can sign up for any course they are interested in as long as they have the access to the Internet. <span class=\"text-blue\">(对于学生，课程选择更加灵活)</span></li>\n            <li>For teachers, they don't need to make the <span class=\"text-red\">roll call,</span> because the system can record automatically. Besides, they can also assign, collect and review the homework more conveniently. <span class=\"text-blue\">(对于老师，教学更加便捷)</span></li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"main-section\">\n        <div class=\"main-point\"><span class=\"bullet\">&#8226;</span> Cons 不足</div>\n        <ul class=\"sub-list\">\n            <li>Online courses may be effective for <span class=\"text-red\">self-directed</span> learners, but students who are not organized and in possession of good time-management skills may struggle. <span class=\"text-blue\">(对于自驱型学习者有效，反之，效果不佳)</span></li>\n            <li>Online education is lacking in teacher-student interaction. It's more difficult for teachers to ask feedbacks from students. And students also can't ask questions immediately. <span class=\"text-blue\">(师生间缺少互动)</span></li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"main-section\">\n        <div class=\"main-point\"><span class=\"bullet\">&#8226;</span> Conclusion 结论</div>\n        <ul class=\"sub-list\">\n            <li>Therefore, students should ask themselves whether they are capable of learning independently before signing up for online coursework. <span class=\"text-blue\">(所以在参与线上课程之前，学生首先应该对自己的自主学习能力有所判断)</span></li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
